tton" type="button" aria-label="Outline" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk OverviewRepoFiles-module_pEDwGW_ActionMenu_Button" data-loading="false" data-size="medium" data-variant="invisible" id="_R_hkdaidcl7d1cb6_"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-list-unordered" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M5.75 2.5h8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5Zm0 5h8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5Zm0 5h8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-8.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM2 14a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Zm1-6a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0ZM2 4a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="js-snippet-clipboard-copy-unpositioned DirectoryRichtextContent-module_ArZdLq_SharedMarkdownContent" data-hpc="true" containertiming="hpc"><article class="markdown-body entry-content container-lg" itemprop="text"><div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h1 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Homework: Fixing a Conda Environment</h1><a id="user-content-homework-fixing-a-conda-environment" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Homework: Fixing a Conda Environment" href="#homework-fixing-a-conda-environment"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">In this assignment you will clone a repository, build a conda environment, fix a <strong>package version conflict</strong> in it, run a script, and submit proof that it worked by pushing to this repo.</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Heads up:</strong> The environment is broken on purpose. The <code>conda env create</code> step in Part 2 will fail. Figuring out why and fixing it is the assignment.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">What you'll turn in</h2><a id="user-content-what-youll-turn-in" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: What you'll turn in" href="#what-youll-turn-in"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">A folder named <code>[your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;/</code> pushed to this repository, containing:</p>
<ol dir="auto">
<li><code>screenshot.png</code>: a screenshot of your terminal showing <code>python run_example.py</code> succeeding (see Part 4)</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Part 0: Set up</h2><a id="user-content-part-0-set-up" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Part 0: Set up" href="#part-0-set-up"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>If you don't have email access set up a github account using your personal email.</li>
<li>Open a terminal and navigate to your Desktop. If you are in windows use WSL (you might have to install it). If you are using a mac run git --version and follow the instructions.</li>
<li>You will need to login to github from your terminal. First you need to install brew. /bin/bash -c "$(curl -fsSL <a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh" rel="nofollow">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh</a>)"</li>
<li>I recommend using github CLI. Run <code>brew install gh</code>.</li>
<li>run <code>  gh auth login</code> in terminal</li>
<li>Select Github.com as the type to authenticate and choose HTTPS</li>
<li>Authenticate with y using git in the terminal</li>
<li>Login to the Web and use the one time code from your terminal to login.</li>
<li><strong>NB: If you decide to use SSH authentication you will be on your own</strong></li>
</ul>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Part 1: Fork and download the repository</h2><a id="user-content-part-1-fork-and-download-the-repository" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Part 1: Fork and download the repository" href="#part-1-fork-and-download-the-repository"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto">Go to <a href="https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class">https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class</a> and click <strong>Fork</strong> (top right), then
<strong>Create fork</strong>. This makes your own copy of the repo at
<code>https://github.com/&lt;your-github-username&gt;/HW_Python_Class</code>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Clone <strong>your fork</strong> (not the class repo):</p>
</li>
</ol>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="git clone https://github.com/&lt;your-github-username&gt;/HW_Python_Class.git
cd HW_Python_Class
git remote add upstream https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class.git
git update-index --skip-worktree environment.yml
git checkout -b FirstName_LastName"><pre>git clone https://github.com/<span class="pl-k">&lt;</span>your-github-username<span class="pl-k">&gt;</span>/HW_Python_Class.git
<span class="pl-c1">cd</span> HW_Python_Class
git remote add upstream https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class.git
git update-index --skip-worktree environment.yml
git checkout -b FirstName_LastName</pre></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto"><code>origin</code> is your fork (where you push). <code>upstream</code> is the class repo (where you get updates).</h2><a id="user-content-origin-is-your-fork-where-you-push-upstream-is-the-class-repo-where-you-get-updates" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: origin is your fork (where you push). upstream is the class repo (where you get updates)." href="#origin-is-your-fork-where-you-push-upstream-is-the-class-repo-where-you-get-updates"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Part 2: Try to create the environment</h2><a id="user-content-part-2-try-to-create-the-environment" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Part 2: Try to create the environment" href="#part-2-try-to-create-the-environment"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">The file <code>environment.yml</code> lists the Python version and packages this project needs. Ask conda to build an environment from it:</p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="conda env create -f environment.yml"><pre class="notranslate"><code>conda env create -f environment.yml
</code></pre></div>
<hr>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Part 3: Fix the environment</h2><a id="user-content-part-3-fix-the-environment" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Part 3: Fix the environment" href="#part-3-fix-the-environment"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Open <code>environment.yml</code> in a text editor. Your job is to change it so conda can install everything together.
In particular, we want the latest version of numpy.</h2><a id="user-content-open-environmentyml-in-a-text-editor-your-job-is-to-change-it-so-conda-can-install-everything-togetherin-particular-we-want-the-latest-version-of-numpy" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Open environment.yml in a text editor. Your job is to change it so conda can install everything together.
In particular, we want the latest version of numpy." href="#open-environmentyml-in-a-text-editor-your-job-is-to-change-it-so-conda-can-install-everything-togetherin-particular-we-want-the-latest-version-of-numpy"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Part 4: Run the code</h2><a id="user-content-part-4-run-the-code" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Part 4: Run the code" href="#part-4-run-the-code"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">Activate the hw-env to make sure if builds correctly after your changes.</p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="conda env create -f environment.yml
conda activate hw-env"><pre class="notranslate"><code>conda env create -f environment.yml
conda activate hw-env
</code></pre></div>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="python run_example.py"><pre class="notranslate"><code>python run_example.py
</code></pre></div>
<p dir="auto">Expected output (your exact version numbers may differ):</p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="hi
numpy (version) | pandas version"><pre class="notranslate"><code>hi
numpy (version) | pandas version
</code></pre></div>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Take a screenshot</strong> of your terminal showing the command and both output lines. Save it as <code>screenshot.png</code>.</p>
<hr>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Part 5: Submit by pushing to the repo</h2><a id="user-content-part-5-submit-by-pushing-to-the-repo" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Part 5: Submit by pushing to the repo" href="#part-5-submit-by-pushing-to-the-repo"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Get the latest changes</strong> so your push isn't rejected:</p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="git pull upstream main"><pre class="notranslate"><code>git pull upstream main
</code></pre></div>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Make your submission folder</strong> using your GitHub username:</p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="mkdir [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;"><pre class="notranslate"><code>mkdir [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;
</code></pre></div>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Put your files in it:</strong></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Move <code>screenshot.png</code> into the folder.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Commit and push:</strong></p>
<div class="snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="git add [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;
git commit -m &quot;Submission: &lt;your-github-username&gt;&quot;
git push -u origin FirstName_LastName"><pre class="notranslate"><code>git add [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;
git commit -m "Submission: &lt;your-github-username&gt;"
git push -u origin FirstName_LastName
</code></pre></div>
<p dir="auto">There will be a link: <a href="https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class/pull/new/FirstName_LastName">https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class/pull/new/FirstName_LastName</a>. Follow the link and  create the the pull request.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Only add files inside your own folder.</strong> Don't change anyone else's files.</p>
</blockquote>
</article></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="prc-PageLayout-PaneWrapper-pHPop pr-2" style="--offset-header:0px;--spacing-row:var(--spacing-none);--spacing-column:var(--spacing-none)" data-is-hidden="false" data-position="end"><div class="prc-PageLayout-HorizontalDivider-JLVqp prc-PageLayout-PaneHorizontalDivider-9tbnE" data-component="PageLayout.HorizontalDivider" data-variant-narrow="none" data-variant-regular="none" data-position="end" style="--spacing-divider:var(--spacing-none);--spacing:var(--spacing-none)"></div><div class="prc-PageLayout-Pane-AyzHK" data-component="SplitPageLayout.Pane" style="--spacing:var(--spacing-normal);--pane-min-width:256px;--pane-max-width:calc(100vw - var(--pane-max-width-diff));--pane-width-size:var(--pane-width-large);--pane-width:320px"><!--&--><div class="CodeViewSidebar-module_6TmlqG_borderGrid"><div class="SidebarSection-module_TOhNLG_sidebarSection OverviewSidebar-module_PLu75W_HideWhenNarrow border-0"><h2 class="SidebarSection-module_TOhNLG_sectionHeading prc-Heading-Heading-MtWFE" data-variant="small" data-component="Heading"><span><span class="SidebarAbout-module_eqNI3a_aboutHeading"><span>About</span><button type="button" class="SidebarAbout-module_eqNI3a_editButton" aria-label="Edit repository metadata"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-gear" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M8 0a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 .701.031C9.444.095 9.99.645 10.16 1.29l.288 1.107c.018.066.079.158.212.224.231.114.454.243.668.386.123.082.233.09.299.071l1.103-.303c.644-.176 1.392.021 1.82.63.27.385.506.792.704 1.218.315.675.111 1.422-.364 1.891l-.814.806c-.049.048-.098.147-.088.294.016.257.016.515 0 .772-.01.147.038.246.088.294l.814.806c.475.469.679 1.216.364 1.891a7.977 7.977 0 0 1-.704 1.217c-.428.61-1.176.807-1.82.63l-1.102-.302c-.067-.019-.177-.011-.3.071a5.909 5.909 0 0