protocol_type=push"},platformInfo:$R[290]={cloneUrl:"https://desktop.github.com",showVisualStudioCloneButton:!1,visualStudioCloneUrl:"https://windows.github.com",showXcodeCloneButton:!1,xcodeCloneUrl:"xcode://clone?repo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fsiobhancm%2FHW_Python_Class",zipballUrl:"/siobhancm/HW_Python_Class/archive/refs/heads/main.zip"}},repoPolicyInfo:$R[291]={allowed:!0,canBill:!0,changesWouldBeSafe:!0,disabledByBusiness:!1,disabledByOrganization:!1,hasIpAllowLists:!1},currentUserIsEnterpriseManaged:!1,enterpriseManagedBusinessName:null,codespacesEnabled:!0,hasAccessToCodespaces:!0},popovers:$R[292]={rename:null,renamedParentRepo:null},commitCount:"25",overviewFiles:$R[293]=[$R[294]={displayName:"README.md",repoName:"HW_Python_Class",refName:"main",path:"README.md",preferredFileType:"readme",tabName:"README",richText:"\x3Carticle class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\">\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Homework: Fixing a Conda Environment\x3C/h1>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-homework-fixing-a-conda-environment\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Homework: Fixing a Conda Environment\" href=\"#homework-fixing-a-conda-environment\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">In this assignment you will clone a repository, build a conda environment, fix a \x3Cstrong>package version conflict\x3C/strong> in it, run a script, and submit proof that it worked by pushing to this repo.\x3C/p>\n\x3Cblockquote>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">\x3Cstrong>Heads up:\x3C/strong> The environment is broken on purpose. The \x3Ccode>conda env create\x3C/code> step in Part 2 will fail. Figuring out why and fixing it is the assignment.\x3C/p>\n\x3C/blockquote>\n\x3Chr>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">What you'll turn in\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-what-youll-turn-in\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What you'll turn in\" href=\"#what-youll-turn-in\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">A folder named \x3Ccode>[your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;/\x3C/code> pushed to this repository, containing:\x3C/p>\n\x3Col dir=\"auto\">\n\x3Cli>\x3Ccode>screenshot.png\x3C/code>: a screenshot of your terminal showing \x3Ccode>python run_example.py\x3C/code> succeeding (see Part 4)\x3C/li>\n\x3C/ol>\n\x3Chr>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Part 0: Set up\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-part-0-set-up\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Part 0: Set up\" href=\"#part-0-set-up\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cul dir=\"auto\">\n\x3Cli>If you don't have email access set up a github account using your personal email.\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>Open a terminal and navigate to your Desktop. If you are in windows use WSL (you might have to install it). If you are using a mac run git --version and follow the instructions.\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>You will need to login to github from your terminal. First you need to install brew. /bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL \x3Ca href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh\x3C/a>)\"\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>I recommend using github CLI. Run \x3Ccode>brew install gh\x3C/code>.\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>run \x3Ccode>  gh auth login\x3C/code> in terminal\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>Select Github.com as the type to authenticate and choose HTTPS\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>Authenticate with y using git in the terminal\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>Login to the Web and use the one time code from your terminal to login.\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>\x3Cstrong>NB: If you decide to use SSH authentication you will be on your own\x3C/strong>\x3C/li>\n\x3C/ul>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Part 1: Fork and download the repository\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-part-1-fork-and-download-the-repository\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Part 1: Fork and download the repository\" href=\"#part-1-fork-and-download-the-repository\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Col dir=\"auto\">\n\x3Cli>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">Go to \x3Ca href=\"https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class\">https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class\x3C/a> and click \x3Cstrong>Fork\x3C/strong> (top right), then\n\x3Cstrong>Create fork\x3C/strong>. This makes your own copy of the repo at\n\x3Ccode>https://github.com/&lt;your-github-username&gt;/HW_Python_Class\x3C/code>.\x3C/p>\n\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">Clone \x3Cstrong>your fork\x3C/strong> (not the class repo):\x3C/p>\n\x3C/li>\n\x3C/ol>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/&lt;your-github-username&gt;/HW_Python_Class.git\ncd HW_Python_Class\ngit remote add upstream https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class.git\ngit update-index --skip-worktree environment.yml\ngit checkout -b FirstName_LastName\">\x3Cpre>git clone https://github.com/\x3Cspan class=\"pl-k\">&lt;\x3C/span>your-github-username\x3Cspan class=\"pl-k\">&gt;\x3C/span>/HW_Python_Class.git\n\x3Cspan class=\"pl-c1\">cd\x3C/span> HW_Python_Class\ngit remote add upstream https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class.git\ngit update-index --skip-worktree environment.yml\ngit checkout -b FirstName_LastName\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ccode>origin\x3C/code> is your fork (where you push). \x3Ccode>upstream\x3C/code> is the class repo (where you get updates).\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-origin-is-your-fork-where-you-push-upstream-is-the-class-repo-where-you-get-updates\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: origin is your fork (where you push). upstream is the class repo (where you get updates).\" href=\"#origin-is-your-fork-where-you-push-upstream-is-the-class-repo-where-you-get-updates\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Part 2: Try to create the environment\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-part-2-try-to-create-the-environment\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Part 2: Try to create the environment\" href=\"#part-2-try-to-create-the-environment\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">The file \x3Ccode>environment.yml\x3C/code> lists the Python version and packages this project needs. Ask conda to build an environment from it:\x3C/p>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"conda env create -f environment.yml\">\x3Cpre class=\"notranslate\">\x3Ccode>conda env create -f environment.yml\n\x3C/code>\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3Chr>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Part 3: Fix the environment\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-part-3-fix-the-environment\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Part 3: Fix the environment\" href=\"#part-3-fix-the-environment\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Open \x3Ccode>environment.yml\x3C/code> in a text editor. Your job is to change it so conda can install everything together.\nIn particular, we want the latest version of numpy.\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-open-environmentyml-in-a-text-editor-your-job-is-to-change-it-so-conda-can-install-everything-togetherin-particular-we-want-the-latest-version-of-numpy\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Open environment.yml in a text editor. Your job is to change it so conda can install everything together.\nIn particular, we want the latest version of numpy.\" href=\"#open-environmentyml-in-a-text-editor-your-job-is-to-change-it-so-conda-can-install-everything-togetherin-particular-we-want-the-latest-version-of-numpy\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Part 4: Run the code\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-part-4-run-the-code\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Part 4: Run the code\" href=\"#part-4-run-the-code\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">Activate the hw-env to make sure if builds correctly after your changes.\x3C/p>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"conda env create -f environment.yml\nconda activate hw-env\">\x3Cpre class=\"notranslate\">\x3Ccode>conda env create -f environment.yml\nconda activate hw-env\n\x3C/code>\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"python run_example.py\">\x3Cpre class=\"notranslate\">\x3Ccode>python run_example.py\n\x3C/code>\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">Expected output (your exact version numbers may differ):\x3C/p>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"hi\nnumpy (version) | pandas version\">\x3Cpre class=\"notranslate\">\x3Ccode>hi\nnumpy (version) | pandas version\n\x3C/code>\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">\x3Cstrong>Take a screenshot\x3C/strong> of your terminal showing the command and both output lines. Save it as \x3Ccode>screenshot.png\x3C/code>.\x3C/p>\n\x3Chr>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\">\x3Ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Part 5: Submit by pushing to the repo\x3C/h2>\x3Ca id=\"user-content-part-5-submit-by-pushing-to-the-repo\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Part 5: Submit by pushing to the repo\" href=\"#part-5-submit-by-pushing-to-the-repo\">\x3Csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\x3Cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\">\x3C/path>\x3C/svg>\x3C/a>\x3C/div>\n\x3Col dir=\"auto\">\n\x3Cli>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">\x3Cstrong>Get the latest changes\x3C/strong> so your push isn't rejected:\x3C/p>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git pull upstream main\">\x3Cpre class=\"notranslate\">\x3Ccode>git pull upstream main\n\x3C/code>\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">\x3Cstrong>Make your submission folder\x3C/strong> using your GitHub username:\x3C/p>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"mkdir [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;\">\x3Cpre class=\"notranslate\">\x3Ccode>mkdir [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;\n\x3C/code>\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">\x3Cstrong>Put your files in it:\x3C/strong>\x3C/p>\n\x3Cul dir=\"auto\">\n\x3Cli>Move \x3Ccode>screenshot.png\x3C/code> into the folder.\x3C/li>\n\x3C/ul>\n\x3C/li>\n\x3Cli>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">\x3Cstrong>Commit and push:\x3C/strong>\x3C/p>\n\x3Cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git add [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;\ngit commit -m &quot;Submission: &lt;your-github-username&gt;&quot;\ngit push -u origin FirstName_LastName\">\x3Cpre class=\"notranslate\">\x3Ccode>git add [your group]/&lt;your-github-username&gt;\ngit commit -m \"Submission: &lt;your-github-username&gt;\"\ngit push -u origin FirstName_LastName\n\x3C/code>\x3C/pre>\x3C/div>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">There will be a link: \x3Ca href=\"https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class/pull/new/FirstName_LastName\">https://github.com/Tonnar/HW_Python_Class/pull/new/FirstName_LastName\x3C/a>. Follow the link and  create the the pull request.\x3C/p>\n\x3C/li>\n\x3C/ol>\n\x3Cblockquote>\n\x3Cp dir=\"auto\">\x3Cstrong>Only add files inside your own folder.\x3C/strong> Don't change anyone else's files.\x3C/p>\n\x3C/blockquote>\n\x3C/article>",loaded:!0,timedOut:!1,errorMessage:null,headerInfo:$R[295]={toc:$R[296]=[$R[297]={level:1,text:"Homework: Fixing a Conda Environment",anchor:"homework-fixing-a-conda-environment",htmlText:"Homework: Fixing a Conda Environment"},$R[298]={level:2,text:"What you'll turn in",anchor:"what-youll-turn-in",htmlText:"What you'll turn in"},$R[299]={level:2,text:"Part 0: Set up",anchor:"part-0-set-up",htmlText:"Part 0: Set up"},$R[300]={level:2,text:"Part 1: Fork and download the repository",anchor:"part-1-fork-and-download-the-repository",htmlText:"Part 1: Fork and download the repository"},$R[301]={level:2,text:"origin is your fork (where you push). upstream is the class repo (where you get updates).",anchor:"origin-is-your-fork-where-you-push-upstream-is-the-class-repo-where-you-get-updates",htmlText:"origin is your fork (where you push). upstream is the class repo (where you get updates)."},$R[302]={level:2,text:"Part 2: Try to create the environment",anch